1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:03,378
[BILLY] <i>Do you know what caused the fire?</i>

2
00:00:03,461 --> 00:00:05,463
[CLERK] <i>No one knows, miss.</i>

3
00:00:05,547 --> 00:00:08,758
<i>All I heard was that Mariela survived.</i>

4
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:10,468
<i>And so did her youngest daughter.</i>

5
00:00:10,552 --> 00:00:12,804
<i>But her eldest daughter died.</i>

6
00:00:12,887 --> 00:00:14,597
[JORDAN] <i>When did the fire happen?</i>

7
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:18,143
[CLERK] <i>About 12 to 13 years ago, I think.</i>

8
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:20,854
[BILLY]<i> But the father</i>
<i>wasn't with them?</i>

9
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:22,897
[CLERK]
<i>No, he wasn't.</i>

10
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:26,443
<i>The rumor is that</i>
<i>Mariela's husband left her.</i>

11
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:28,236
[MARIELA SCREAMING]

12
00:00:28,319 --> 00:00:29,154
<i>Ma.</i>

13
00:00:29,237 --> 00:00:31,114
<i>Ma?</i>

14
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:32,991
<i>I'm here, Ma.</i>

15
00:00:33,074 --> 00:00:36,578
<i>- Hmm?</i>
<i>- As long as your father</i>

16
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:38,329
<i>and his mistress are together</i>

17
00:00:40,081 --> 00:00:44,544
<i>with that Billy and her little brother,</i>

18
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,465
<i>those bastard children…</i>

19
00:00:50,967 --> 00:00:53,845
<i>I will never be okay.</i>

20
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:57,724
<i>Billy, please. I need more time with him.</i>

21
00:00:57,807 --> 00:01:00,852
<i>It's already more than enough that</i>
<i>you were given the chance</i>

22
00:01:00,935 --> 00:01:02,729
<i>to spend time with Oliver.</i>

23
00:01:02,812 --> 00:01:05,565
<i>I know my brother will be hurt</i>

24
00:01:05,648 --> 00:01:09,069
when he finds out that
I stopped you from seeing him.

25
00:01:11,654 --> 00:01:14,324
<i>Inhale, exhale, Peter.</i>

26
00:01:14,407 --> 00:01:16,409
<i>Just do what I asked, okay?</i>

27
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:20,872
<i>Hack into LoveLine ASAP.</i>

28
00:01:20,955 --> 00:01:22,373
<i>- Clear?</i>
<i>- Yes.</i>

29
00:01:22,457 --> 00:01:24,042
<i>I'm working on it.</i>

30
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:25,752
[BEA] <i>You better be.</i>

31
00:01:28,505 --> 00:01:30,423
<i>Because if you don't do it,</i>

32
00:01:31,049 --> 00:01:34,093
<i>your photos will go viral.</i>

33
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:35,428
<i>I'm telling you.</i>

34
00:01:42,101 --> 00:01:44,395
Sorry, chief. Sir Peter's here.

35
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:47,482
<i>Huh? You didn't tell me</i>
<i>he was coming today.</i>

36
00:01:47,565 --> 00:01:49,109
<i>He just suddenly arrived.</i>

37
00:01:49,192 --> 00:01:51,152
<i>I thought you were expecting him.</i>

38
00:01:54,864 --> 00:01:55,698
<i>Hi!</i>

39
00:01:55,782 --> 00:01:57,158
<i>- Peter!</i>
<i>- Hi!</i>

40
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:58,868
<i>Sorry, I wasn't expecting you.</i>

41
00:01:58,952 --> 00:01:59,869
<i>Hi. Yeah…</i>

42
00:01:59,953 --> 00:02:03,164
<i>Now, I expect you to fulfill</i>
<i>your end of the deal.</i>

43
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:07,252
<i>Delete those photos.</i>

44
00:02:07,335 --> 00:02:09,045
[BEA] <i>You know, Peter,</i>

45
00:02:09,129 --> 00:02:11,297
<i>our deal was simple.</i>

46
00:02:11,381 --> 00:02:14,134
<i>Once LoveList is completely ruined,</i>

47
00:02:14,217 --> 00:02:17,387
<i>that's when I'll delete all the pictures.</i>

48
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:19,597
<i>Okay? Thank you.</i>

49
00:02:23,143 --> 00:02:26,437
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

50
00:02:27,397 --> 00:02:29,482
- [VALERIE]<i> Billy? We have a problem.</i>
- [BILLY]<i> Yes?</i>

51
00:02:29,566 --> 00:02:31,734
<i>Someone posted this,</i>
<i>and it's getting traction.</i>

52
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:34,779
<i>"Your secret's not safe with LoveList."</i>

53
00:02:34,863 --> 00:02:38,867
<i>"Confidential LoveLine conversations</i>
<i>and member information leaked."</i>

54
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:41,327
<i>Why does the message say that?</i>
<i>What's going on?</i>

55
00:02:42,078 --> 00:02:42,912
[BILLY] <i>Hello?</i>

56
00:02:44,956 --> 00:02:45,957
<i>Jordan.</i>

57
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:51,754
[DISTANT BIRDS CHIRPING]

58
00:02:51,838 --> 00:02:54,048
Someone definitely tried
to leak the files.

59
00:02:55,508 --> 00:02:57,093
Tough luck for them,

60
00:02:57,176 --> 00:03:00,013
all of our confidential data is encrypted.

61
00:03:00,555 --> 00:03:02,015
And we have a second layer of protection,

62
00:03:02,098 --> 00:03:06,019
so if anyone tries to hack,
leak our files,

63
00:03:06,102 --> 00:03:07,395
this will pop up.

64
00:03:07,979 --> 00:03:10,607
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

65
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:12,692
[EXHALES] Okay, good.

66
00:03:14,444 --> 00:03:16,821
But, dude, how did they obtain our data?

67
00:03:18,114 --> 00:03:20,617
Good thing you went ahead
with the security measures.

68
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:24,537
Well, you hired
a great cybersecurity group.

69
00:03:25,330 --> 00:03:27,707
So, your investment paid off.

70
00:03:28,416 --> 00:03:30,376
Besides, you were the one
who reminded me, right?

71
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:32,295
To protect our secrets.

72
00:03:34,422 --> 00:03:36,299
I'm curious how they slipped
under our noses.

73
00:03:36,382 --> 00:03:40,428
I checked with security,
and no one got in that we didn't know.

74
00:03:40,511 --> 00:03:42,347
Do you think it was Bea again?

75
00:03:42,972 --> 00:03:44,515
Caloy is in prison, isn't he?

76
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:49,354
So who would she send this time
to gain access to our computers?

77
00:03:49,437 --> 00:03:56,027
[MUSIC BUILDING UP]

78
00:03:56,861 --> 00:03:58,363
[KEYBOARD CLACKING]

79
00:03:58,446 --> 00:04:04,869
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

80
00:04:04,953 --> 00:04:07,747
- [MUSIC FADING]
- [TRAFFIC NOISE]

81
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:09,290
[BEA] What the heck is that?

82
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:10,583
Explain this!

83
00:04:10,667 --> 00:04:12,001
What are you talking about?

84
00:04:12,085 --> 00:04:13,878
"What are you talking about"?
See for yourself!

85
00:04:13,962 --> 00:04:15,463
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

86
00:04:15,546 --> 00:04:17,757
- [COMPUTER WHIRRING]
- Look, that's a virus!

87
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,634
Just look! Your files are corrupted!

88
00:04:19,717 --> 00:04:22,053
No, it's encrypted.

89
00:04:22,136 --> 00:04:24,180
Huh? What the heck do you mean?

90
00:04:24,264 --> 00:04:26,891
Encrypted!
Meaning their data is protected!

91
00:04:26,975 --> 00:04:29,394
That's why all the text
looks scrambled like that,

92
00:04:29,477 --> 00:04:30,770
so that no one can read it.

93
00:04:30,853 --> 00:04:32,981
No one can leak or spread
confidential information

94
00:04:33,064 --> 00:04:34,524
about their clients.

95
00:04:34,607 --> 00:04:36,317
[BEA INHALES SHARPLY, GROANS]

96
00:04:36,401 --> 00:04:38,319
So you mean it's useless?

97
00:04:38,403 --> 00:04:42,198
Yeah. Only an authorized
user can decode it.

98
00:04:42,782 --> 00:04:43,741
Look,

99
00:04:44,701 --> 00:04:46,911
there's not much we can do here.

100
00:04:47,537 --> 00:04:48,788
But I did my part,

101
00:04:48,871 --> 00:04:51,165
so please delete the photos.

102
00:04:51,958 --> 00:04:53,001
[SCOFFS]

103
00:04:53,501 --> 00:04:55,670
I don't think so. Not yet.

104
00:04:56,296 --> 00:04:58,298
What?! Are you kidding me?

105
00:04:58,381 --> 00:05:00,133
This is not what we talked about!

106
00:05:00,216 --> 00:05:02,552
You said steal the files
and you'll delete the photos!

107
00:05:02,635 --> 00:05:03,970
And that's what I did!

108
00:05:04,053 --> 00:05:06,097
- [SCOFFS]
- [BREATHING HEAVILY]

109
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:08,516
What, are you going to hit me?

110
00:05:08,599 --> 00:05:10,601
Go! Go ahead. Hit me.

111
00:05:10,685 --> 00:05:11,978
Come on, hit me.

112
00:05:12,061 --> 00:05:14,355
Do it. Hit me, Peter.

113
00:05:14,981 --> 00:05:16,733
Want me to make a scene?

114
00:05:16,816 --> 00:05:18,234
Look around.

115
00:05:18,318 --> 00:05:20,028
We've got their attention.

116
00:05:20,528 --> 00:05:21,821
- Hmm?
- [BREATHES HEAVILY]

117
00:05:23,072 --> 00:05:24,407
Go on, hit me.

118
00:05:25,158 --> 00:05:27,452
- [SIGHING DEEPLY]
- [MUSIC SWELLING]

119
00:05:27,535 --> 00:05:28,828
[MUSIC FADES]

120
00:05:28,911 --> 00:05:31,622
You really think you scare me, Peter?

121
00:05:31,706 --> 00:05:32,790
Hmm?

122
00:05:33,374 --> 00:05:34,709
If I were you…

123
00:05:36,753 --> 00:05:38,004
I would behave.

124
00:05:38,713 --> 00:05:39,797
Okay?

125
00:05:40,423 --> 00:05:42,592
You need to behave,

126
00:05:42,675 --> 00:05:44,302
or else

127
00:05:44,385 --> 00:05:47,180
they will find out about you.

128
00:05:47,263 --> 00:05:48,347
And I mean everybody.

129
00:05:48,431 --> 00:05:49,390
[SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING]

130
00:05:49,474 --> 00:05:50,516
Hmm?

131
00:05:51,017 --> 00:05:52,602
Be a good boy, okay?

132
00:05:54,312 --> 00:05:55,354
Peter.

133
00:05:56,647 --> 00:05:58,483
I'm not done with you yet.

134
00:05:58,566 --> 00:06:01,444
So if I call you,
you'd better answer right away.

135
00:06:01,527 --> 00:06:02,403
Okay?

136
00:06:04,030 --> 00:06:05,073
Yes?

137
00:06:06,365 --> 00:06:07,450
Yes.

138
00:06:10,369 --> 00:06:15,583
[SINISTER MUSIC CONTINUES]

139
00:06:15,666 --> 00:06:16,667
[LAPTOP SLAMS SHUT]

140
00:06:18,836 --> 00:06:19,879
[GROANS]

141
00:06:22,006 --> 00:06:28,721
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

142
00:07:08,386 --> 00:07:11,889
Marj found out that Peter is staying here.

143
00:07:11,973 --> 00:07:15,726
He made some posts tagging this location,
Summit Bay Hotel.

144
00:07:16,269 --> 00:07:18,729
Then suddenly, those posts disappeared.

145
00:07:18,813 --> 00:07:20,481
That's a bit weird, isn't it?

146
00:07:21,524 --> 00:07:23,985
So, wait. You think it's really him?

147
00:07:25,570 --> 00:07:28,281
Dude, he invested 30 million in us.

148
00:07:29,157 --> 00:07:32,827
It makes no sense if he actually
wants the company to fail.

149
00:07:32,910 --> 00:07:36,205
We are here to ask a few questions, and…

150
00:07:37,165 --> 00:07:38,958
Let's see what happens.

151
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,752
Peter.

152
00:07:41,836 --> 00:07:42,795
- Billy.
- Hi.

153
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:43,796
- Jordan.
- Hi.

154
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,922
Hi.

155
00:07:45,715 --> 00:07:47,425
What brings you here?

156
00:07:47,508 --> 00:07:48,843
Um…

157
00:07:49,594 --> 00:07:51,888
Someone tried to leak
our confidential data.

158
00:07:51,971 --> 00:07:53,264
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

159
00:07:53,347 --> 00:07:55,224
Confidential data?

160
00:07:55,308 --> 00:07:56,559
[BILLY] Yes.

161
00:07:56,642 --> 00:07:58,853
Transcript of LoveLine calls,

162
00:07:58,936 --> 00:08:02,023
along with other sensitive information

163
00:08:02,106 --> 00:08:03,649
about our members.

164
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:06,444
But fortunately,

165
00:08:06,527 --> 00:08:09,071
we have upgraded
our cybersecurity systems,

166
00:08:09,155 --> 00:08:10,990
so we are good.

167
00:08:11,616 --> 00:08:13,326
T-That's good.

168
00:08:14,076 --> 00:08:15,369
Should I be worried?

169
00:08:15,453 --> 00:08:16,871
No.

170
00:08:16,954 --> 00:08:18,831
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

171
00:08:18,915 --> 00:08:19,999
[MUSIC FADES]

172
00:08:20,958 --> 00:08:23,211
You were at the office yesterday, and--

173
00:08:23,294 --> 00:08:24,378
And we…

174
00:08:24,462 --> 00:08:27,465
we just wanted to be
transparent with you, Peter.

175
00:08:28,090 --> 00:08:30,176
- Uh, that's why we're here.
- Right.

176
00:08:30,259 --> 00:08:32,970
To inform you about the attempted leak

177
00:08:33,054 --> 00:08:35,389
before you hear about it
from someone else.

178
00:08:35,473 --> 00:08:36,766
We want you to hear from us first.

179
00:08:36,849 --> 00:08:38,893
- Right, right.
- [JORDAN] Right?

180
00:08:38,976 --> 00:08:40,770
And as you can see,

181
00:08:40,853 --> 00:08:44,065
our security measures are all in place,
so nothing to worry about.

182
00:08:44,148 --> 00:08:45,983
Thank you. I… I appreciate that.

183
00:08:46,067 --> 00:08:47,401
- [PHONE RINGING]
- Thanks. Thanks.

184
00:08:47,485 --> 00:08:48,444
I…

185
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:50,071
Listen. I-I gotta go.

186
00:08:50,154 --> 00:08:51,572
[RINGING CONTINUES]

187
00:08:51,656 --> 00:08:52,782
[BILLY] Okay.

188
00:08:52,865 --> 00:08:55,910
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

189
00:08:55,993 --> 00:08:57,036
What?!

190
00:08:57,119 --> 00:08:58,746
What did you tell them?

191
00:08:58,829 --> 00:09:00,748
Nothing! I swear!

192
00:09:00,831 --> 00:09:03,584
I warn you, Peter. Okay?

193
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:07,171
If you talk, I will ruin your life!

194
00:09:07,713 --> 00:09:08,756
Mark my words!

195
00:09:08,839 --> 00:09:11,050
Okay, okay.
Look, I'll talk to you later.

196
00:09:11,133 --> 00:09:12,760
I have business to attend to.

197
00:09:12,843 --> 00:09:14,011
[BREATHES DEEPLY]

198
00:09:14,762 --> 00:09:19,976
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

199
00:09:20,059 --> 00:09:21,477
Sorry, I cut you off.

200
00:09:22,228 --> 00:09:25,147
I couldn't let you confront him
with just a hunch.

201
00:09:25,231 --> 00:09:26,691
[BILLY] It's okay.

202
00:09:26,774 --> 00:09:28,651
I was just going to ask him.

203
00:09:29,443 --> 00:09:31,737
But did you see it too?
He was acting strange.

204
00:09:31,821 --> 00:09:33,197
Yeah.

205
00:09:33,281 --> 00:09:34,448
But that's not enough.

206
00:09:34,532 --> 00:09:35,950
[MUSIC BECOMES DRAMATIC]

207
00:09:36,033 --> 00:09:37,743
What if you're wrong?

208
00:09:37,827 --> 00:09:39,495
We're going to lose an investor.

209
00:09:40,788 --> 00:09:42,582
What if I'm right?

210
00:09:42,665 --> 00:09:44,375
Yes, you're probably right.

211
00:09:45,167 --> 00:09:47,086
But first, we need proof.

212
00:09:48,379 --> 00:09:49,380
Okay.

213
00:09:53,509 --> 00:09:57,430
[MUSIC INTENSIFYING]

214
00:09:57,513 --> 00:09:58,973
[MUSIC FADES]

215
00:10:00,057 --> 00:10:06,439
[DARK MUSIC PLAYING]

216
00:10:21,954 --> 00:10:28,794
[DARK MUSIC CONTINUES]

217
00:10:42,975 --> 00:10:49,857
[DARK MUSIC CONTINUES]

218
00:11:06,207 --> 00:11:07,375
[WOMAN] <i>What the hell?!</i>

219
00:11:07,458 --> 00:11:09,835
<i>The road is so wide!</i>
<i>Stop blocking the way!</i>

220
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:12,963
<i>- I'm just over here on the side!</i>
<i>- Ugh! Don't you have eyes?!</i>

221
00:11:13,047 --> 00:11:14,799
<i>Stop! Just get out of here!</i>

222
00:11:21,514 --> 00:11:27,561
[DARK MUSIC CONTINUES]

223
00:11:28,687 --> 00:11:31,649
<i>Is Papa not coming home?</i>
<i>Isn't he joining us?</i>

224
00:11:31,732 --> 00:11:35,486
<i>You are so dumb, aren't you?</i>

225
00:11:36,153 --> 00:11:37,738
<i>You're stupid!</i>

226
00:11:38,489 --> 00:11:40,324
<i>You really take after your father.</i>

227
00:11:40,408 --> 00:11:42,201
<i>You're both useless!</i>

228
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,370
<i>So, what?</i>

229
00:11:45,746 --> 00:11:48,249
<i>Are you going to take his side?</i>

230
00:11:48,332 --> 00:11:52,086
<i>Then get out of here and go with him!</i>

231
00:11:52,169 --> 00:11:55,464
<i>You deserve each other anyway!</i>

232
00:12:01,929 --> 00:12:03,013
<i>Ma! Ma!</i>

233
00:12:03,931 --> 00:12:05,850
<i>Ma! Ma!</i>

234
00:12:05,933 --> 00:12:07,351
<i>- Take her.</i>
<i>- Ma.</i>

235
00:12:07,435 --> 00:12:09,186
<i>- Help her.</i>
<i>- Help! Ma.</i>

236
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:12,314
<i>Ma, wake up! Ma!</i>

237
00:12:12,398 --> 00:12:13,607
<i>Ma!</i>

238
00:12:13,691 --> 00:12:18,654
[DARK MUSIC CONTINUES]

239
00:12:18,737 --> 00:12:20,239
[EXHALES DEEPLY]

240
00:12:22,950 --> 00:12:24,243
[MUSIC STOPS]

241
00:12:29,623 --> 00:12:30,749
[DOOR SHUTS]

242
00:12:33,210 --> 00:12:34,170
Ma?

243
00:12:34,253 --> 00:12:39,383
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

244
00:12:41,677 --> 00:12:42,636
Ma?

245
00:12:43,262 --> 00:12:47,725
[UNSETTLING MUSIC CONTINUES]

246
00:12:54,523 --> 00:12:58,569
[LINE RINGING]

247
00:12:59,487 --> 00:13:02,198
[BUSY SIGNAL]

248
00:13:08,078 --> 00:13:09,580
[LINE RINGING]

249
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:14,210
[BUSY SIGNAL]

250
00:13:16,295 --> 00:13:20,841
[UNSETTLING MUSIC CONTINUES]

251
00:13:23,427 --> 00:13:24,762
[MUSIC STOPS]

252
00:13:27,056 --> 00:13:29,391
I'm trying to trace the activity
on the workstation

253
00:13:29,475 --> 00:13:31,060
where Peter was sitting.

254
00:13:31,143 --> 00:13:33,562
So we can find out when

255
00:13:33,646 --> 00:13:36,565
and what time the files were downloaded.

256
00:13:37,233 --> 00:13:39,985
But we still need to find out
if he was really

257
00:13:40,069 --> 00:13:42,488
the one who leaked the files online.

258
00:13:42,571 --> 00:13:46,158
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

259
00:13:47,451 --> 00:13:48,327
Hey.

260
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:53,791
Remember, something like this
happened before.

261
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:55,793
And we caught Caloy.

262
00:13:55,876 --> 00:13:57,419
We'll catch this guy too.

263
00:13:58,671 --> 00:14:00,005
Okay?

264
00:14:00,631 --> 00:14:01,632
Okay.

265
00:14:04,468 --> 00:14:05,678
I'm heading home.

266
00:14:07,555 --> 00:14:08,931
See you tomorrow, dude.

267
00:14:09,598 --> 00:14:10,683
See you.

268
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:18,857
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

269
00:14:18,941 --> 00:14:20,025
Thank you.

270
00:14:22,695 --> 00:14:23,696
Good luck!

271
00:14:25,281 --> 00:14:26,615
- Bye, Billy!
- Good night!

272
00:14:26,699 --> 00:14:27,992
- Thank you!
- Take care.

273
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:34,915
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

274
00:14:38,878 --> 00:14:40,254
Boss.

275
00:14:40,337 --> 00:14:42,631
Why don't you just tell her how you feel?

276
00:14:45,926 --> 00:14:48,429
Now's really not the time
to mess with her head.

277
00:14:51,599 --> 00:14:53,142
I'm just waiting for the right time.

278
00:14:56,812 --> 00:15:00,649
I think, boss, for now,

279
00:15:00,733 --> 00:15:04,236
it's better if you just let her know that
you'll always be there for her.

280
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:06,530
Okay.

281
00:15:06,614 --> 00:15:07,781
Yeah? [CHUCKLES]

282
00:15:08,741 --> 00:15:10,826
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

283
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:12,369
Oh, let's get back to work.

284
00:15:12,453 --> 00:15:13,954
- Yeah.
- Okay, sorry.

285
00:15:14,038 --> 00:15:15,581
Boss, aren't you gonna help?

286
00:15:24,673 --> 00:15:29,136
["SANDAL" BY JAMES REID PLAYING]

287
00:15:46,612 --> 00:15:51,241
["SANDAL" CONTINUES]

288
00:16:07,091 --> 00:16:12,262
["SANDAL" CONTINUES]

289
00:16:12,346 --> 00:16:13,973
[MUSIC FADES]

290
00:16:23,857 --> 00:16:25,192
Billy, go to sleep.

291
00:16:25,275 --> 00:16:27,111
Just leave that for tomorrow.

292
00:16:29,822 --> 00:16:32,533
My God, Auntie. We almost lost everything.

293
00:16:33,158 --> 00:16:35,244
Imagine if those files had leaked.

294
00:16:35,828 --> 00:16:37,538
LoveList would've been ruined again.

295
00:16:39,456 --> 00:16:41,208
Was it Bea again?

296
00:16:41,291 --> 00:16:43,293
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

297
00:16:43,377 --> 00:16:44,545
It's possible, Auntie.

298
00:16:44,628 --> 00:16:47,840
But one of our other suspects
is our investor.

299
00:16:48,424 --> 00:16:49,508
But I'm wondering,

300
00:16:49,591 --> 00:16:51,385
why would he want to ruin LoveList

301
00:16:51,468 --> 00:16:53,345
when he invested in it himself?

302
00:16:53,429 --> 00:16:55,806
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

303
00:16:55,889 --> 00:16:58,434
You know what?
You should ask the police for help.

304
00:16:58,517 --> 00:17:00,978
Go ahead. Have them investigate it.

305
00:17:01,603 --> 00:17:02,604
Yes, Auntie.

306
00:17:02,688 --> 00:17:05,315
Jordan's just trying to find
where the files were uploaded

307
00:17:05,399 --> 00:17:08,110
so when we go there, we'll have evidence.

308
00:17:08,694 --> 00:17:09,820
[PRECIOUS] Okay.

309
00:17:11,655 --> 00:17:13,741
Anyway, go to sleep, okay?

310
00:17:15,367 --> 00:17:17,202
- Thank you.
- Okay.

311
00:17:18,662 --> 00:17:24,668
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

312
00:17:30,632 --> 00:17:32,634
You're going to see your eldest?

313
00:17:33,427 --> 00:17:34,928
I'll ask her for a favor.

314
00:17:36,013 --> 00:17:38,974
I'll see if she'll give me
a little more time.

315
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,935
After all, I don't have
much time left here anyway.

316
00:17:42,019 --> 00:17:42,978
Maybe she'll…

317
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:45,064
You're going to tell her
about your illness

318
00:17:45,147 --> 00:17:46,857
so she'll feel sorry for you?

319
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:49,359
Maybe she'll understand me.

320
00:17:50,069 --> 00:17:56,492
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

321
00:17:59,119 --> 00:18:01,413
[MUSIC FADES]

322
00:18:04,416 --> 00:18:10,380
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

323
00:18:27,147 --> 00:18:31,610
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

324
00:18:46,959 --> 00:18:53,882
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

325
00:19:07,896 --> 00:19:13,110
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

326
00:19:28,542 --> 00:19:33,005
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

327
00:19:49,938 --> 00:19:55,694
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

328
00:20:10,918 --> 00:20:16,381
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

329
00:20:32,648 --> 00:20:37,778
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

330
00:20:42,699 --> 00:20:43,533
[DOOR OPENS]

331
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:58,924
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

332
00:21:03,512 --> 00:21:04,846
Mariela?

333
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:09,851
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

334
00:21:14,231 --> 00:21:16,316
<i>They already checked the bars</i>
<i>in the kitchen.</i>

335
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:20,237
<i>But it's bad news.</i>
<i>The metal is still sturdy.</i>

336
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:22,322
[VALERIE] <i>Why can't you just</i>
<i>be honest with her?</i>

337
00:21:23,073 --> 00:21:25,033
<i>Do yourself a favor</i>
<i>and talk to Billy.</i>

338
00:21:25,117 --> 00:21:26,952
<i>And tell her</i>
<i>how much you love her.</i>

339
00:21:27,035 --> 00:21:29,329
<i>Please. Leave us alone.</i>

340
00:21:29,413 --> 00:21:31,790
<i>If it had happened to you,</i>
<i>you'd be angry too.</i>

341
00:21:31,873 --> 00:21:34,042
<i>What's your real problem</i>
<i>with me and my daughter?</i>

342
00:21:34,126 --> 00:21:35,919
[MARIELA]
<i>This should've been ours.</i>

343
00:21:36,003 --> 00:21:41,258
<i>So we won't stop</i>
<i>until we get what's rightfully ours!</i>

344
00:21:43,719 --> 00:21:46,346
[BOTH GRUNTING]

345
00:21:47,889 --> 00:21:49,391
- [THWACKS]
- [MARIELA GRUNTS]

346
00:21:52,311 --> 00:21:53,145
<i>Ma.</i>

347
00:21:53,228 --> 00:21:54,521
<i>Where have you been?</i>

348
00:21:54,604 --> 00:21:56,481
<i>You weren't answering my calls.</i>

349
00:21:56,565 --> 00:21:58,442
<i>Our problem's over.</i>

350
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:03,613
<i>- Wake up, Oliver.</i>
<i>- Billy?</i>

351
00:22:03,697 --> 00:22:05,699
[WOMAN] <i>Do you think</i>
<i>there are still people inside?</i>

352
00:22:05,782 --> 00:22:09,661
[BILLY BREATHING HEAVILY]

353
00:22:09,745 --> 00:22:11,621
- [JORDAN]<i> Billy!</i>
- [BILLY] <i>Help!</i>
